<title>JAPAN: Fukutoku Bank 96/97 stocks book loss 269 mln yen.</title>
<headline>Fukutoku Bank 96/97 stocks book loss 269 mln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fukutoku Bank Ltd said on Friday that its book loss on securities holdings at the end of March 1997 totalled 269 million yen.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its book profit on securities holdings at the end of March 1997 was 4.30 billion yen.</p>
<p>Its net book profit on securities holdings at that date was 4.03 billion yen.</p>
</text>
